でもできるストーリー重視な作品\n★作品が【恐怖：メルヘン：切なさ=7：2：1】くらいのイメージなので、楽曲もこんな感じだと嬉しいです。\n\n作品のより詳しい詳細は資料のURL(Googleドライブ)に添付させて頂きましたので、良かったらご覧下さい。\n\n長文失礼致しました。\n長くなりましたが、ご縁があることを祈っております🥰\n(P.S.  風邪も流行っておりますので、どうぞお身体にはお気をつけください！)\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/180ATbwzGCsQpHCziVrJNoUjsISpigxn6?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 143047, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "すい", "screen_name": "su_sth56", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1775900187405500416/D1QfHYlL.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/911909877370339328/1779023147/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 144}, {"id": 213957, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "鈍挫", "screen_name": "gyosonnotamiyo", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1581370223281963014/5nSMrHOJ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1187287187928178688/1650779742/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 2, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 48}, {"id": 252475, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "極すずね@次はフリートドック神戸改", "screen_name": "kym10o", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007706616632881152/I-ezRXck.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/700577472677449728/1745815258/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank":